you could rationalize the scenario by explaining that cloaks are
resistant ... but i think you'd be happier if a check were made
to see if your cloak should disintegrate before your armor (as
it stands now cloaks never disintegrate this way).  it may turn
out that the fairest thing to do would be to disintegrate the cloak
